name: Owned operational labels stay concise while canonical source evidence stays exact
size: 240x36
cwd: @TMP_TARGET
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART prepare
require-wrapper-flow:
launch: --target "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo"
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | ready
submit: setg ui.auto_open_activity false
submit: setg ui.auto_open_viz false
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 kz> | commands
expect: LOGS
expect: Commands
expect: Desktop alerts unavailable
expect-not: shell route
expect-not: focus unknown
submit: run context:build {"sampleLimit":20,"enrichment":false}
require-live-snap: 35 run receipt | index-produced
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 repo index ready | wide-index-ready
expect-not: ctx:not built
expect-not: repo index not built
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART built @TMP_HOME
type: status-copy draft
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART viewport 240x36
resize: 160x48
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART viewport 160x48
live-snap: index-160x48
expect: status-copy draft
resize: 96x89
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART viewport 96x89
live-snap: index-96x89
expect: status-copy draft
expect: repo index ready
expect: session:$0.00
expect: model:unconfigured
expect: target:./owned  repo
resize: 80x24
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART viewport 80x24
live-snap: index-80x24
expect: status-copy draft
expect: repo index ready
expect: session:$0.00
expect: model:unconfigured
expect: target:./owned  repo
resize: 60x20
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART viewport 60x20
live-snap: index-60x20
expect: status-copy draft
resize: 40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART viewport 40x12
live-snap: index-40x12
expect: status-copy draft
ask: Do the compact startup and launch labels reduce repeated paths while the complete tool result, status and unsent draft remain readable across the viewport matrix?
keys: C-u
nav-mode:
keys: z
require-live-snap: 20 READ TRANSCRIPT | literal-reader-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: literal-reader-page-1-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: literal-reader-page-2-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: literal-reader-page-3-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: literal-reader-page-4-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: literal-reader-page-5-40x12
keys: PPage
live-snap: literal-reader-page-6-40x12
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART reader
ask: Can the operator page through both complete source paths, including the two spaces in the repository name, without invented whitespace or hidden result text?
keys: q
resize: 120x36
submit: scene
require-live-snap: 20 KUZUSHI VIZ | gallery
keys: Tab
require-live-snap: 20 COMPONENT STACK | components
expect: 2 manifests · 1 lockfile
expect-not: 1 lockfiles
expect: declared ^1.0
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
keys: Escape
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
env-unset: ANTHROPIC_API_KEY OPENAI_API_KEY KUZUSHI_MODEL KUZUSHI_LANGGRAPH_BRIDGE NODE_OPTIONS
env: HOME=@TMP_HOME KUZUSHI_SKIP_ONBOARDING=1 KUZUSHI_REDUCED_MOTION=1 NO_COLOR=1
launch: --target "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo"
require-live-snap: 30 KUZUSHI | restarted
resize: 240x36
submit: logs
require-live-snap: 20 kz> | recovered-index
expect: LOGS
expect: repo index ready
expect: Commands
expect-not: MAP VIEW
expect-not: repo index not built
expect-not: Map ✓
expect-not: Scan ✓
wait: 1
live-snap: recovered-index-settled
expect: kz>
expect: LOGS
expect: repo index ready
expect-not: MAP VIEW
require-shell: python3 -B @REPO/scripts/devex/fixtures/operator_status.py "@TMP_TARGET/owned  repo" @ART restarted @TMP_HOME
ask: Does restart retain canonical target identity in session metadata, the run receipt and exact raw result, with one auxiliary run and no new model work?
keys: C-c
require-exit: 10
